# ==========================================
# PROPOSAL KEGIATAN MODULE
# ==========================================

### 1. Lihat Semua Daftar Proposal
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proposals
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Ajukan Proposal Kegiatan Baru
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proposals
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "judul_proposal": "Lomba Classmeeting Semester Ganjil",
    "kategori": "Kegiatan Siswa",
    "anggaran": 2345678,
    "pengaju": "Naura Lutfiah",
    "deskripsi": "Kegiatan perlombaan antar kelas setelah ujian akhir semester."
}

###

### 3. Lihat Detail Proposal Berdasarkan ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proposals/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Perbarui Status & Catatan Proposal (Aksi Pembina)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proposals/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "status": "Disetujui",
    "catatan_pembina": "Anggaran telah disetujui, harap lakukan koordinasi dengan bendahara."
}

###

### 5. Hapus Proposal Kegiatan
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/proposals/1
Accept: application/json
